gin="01:49.750" end="01:53.166">Aperture lets the light in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.166" end="01:55.250">It's best you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.250" end="01:57.233">What you don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.233" end="02:00.153">Aperture lets the light in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.153" end="02:01.653" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.174" end="02:04.518">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.518" end="02:07.828">It finally appears it's only love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.828" end="02:15.356">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.356" end="02:19.519">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.519" end="02:22.755">It finally appears it's only love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.755" end="02:30.343">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.343" end="02:31.843" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.364" end="02:34.289">In no good state to receive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.289" end="02:38.049">Go forth, ask questions later</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.049" end="02:41.753">Trap doors, you're toying with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.753" end="02:49.753">Dance halls, another cadence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.703" end="03:02.203" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.724" end="03:02.857">It's best you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.857" end="03:04.724">What you don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.724" end="03:07.816">Aperture lets the light in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.816" end="03:09.316" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.837" end="03:12.029">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.029" end="03:15.259">It finally appears it's only love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.259" end="03:19.430">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.430" end="03:22.715">It finally appears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.715" end="03:27.059">We belong together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.059" end="03:30.370">It finally appears